00:57:28.900 --> 00:57:31.180
We're counting on you.


00:57:51.900 --> 00:57:54.500
You better make it.


00:57:57.180 --> 00:58:00.060
Just promise me you won't die.


00:58:01.420 --> 00:58:03.900
Okay,


00:58:05.300 --> 00:58:07.700
I promise you.


00:58:07.820 --> 00:58:12.020
You do this and
you come back to me,


00:58:12.140 --> 00:58:14.620
and we're gonna find our home,


00:58:14.740 --> 00:58:18.380
and we'll make
new memories, okay?


00:58:18.500 --> 00:58:20.660
Okay.


00:58:25.460 --> 00:58:27.780
Just promise me that
you'll be careful.


00:58:27.900 --> 00:58:30.580
I will, just don't leave me.


00:59:06.260 --> 00:59:08.540
I don't want to leave you.


00:59:09.540 --> 00:59:12.820
I can look after myself.


00:59:12.940 --> 00:59:14.420
Just make sure you come back.


00:59:14.540 --> 00:59:17.100
Oh, I'm coming back,


00:59:18.380 --> 00:59:19.900
unless you truly believe


00:59:20.020 --> 00:59:24.780
that we can trust the
Controller to free these people.


00:59:26.980 --> 00:59:29.740
Don't trust anyone.


00:59:29.860 --> 00:59:31.660
I mean it,


00:59:31.780 --> 00:59:34.260
not anyone.


00:59:36.180 --> 00:59:38.220
Hey. The fuck you doin' in here?


00:59:38.340 --> 00:59:40.660
You two have plenty
of time for all that.


00:59:40.780 --> 00:59:41.900
Come on, we need to move out.


00:59:42.020 --> 00:59:45.940
Cronus you're
involved in this?


00:59:46.060 --> 00:59:49.340
This is for you, sir.


00:59:50.780 --> 00:59:53.660
Thank you.


01:00:19.460 --> 01:00:24.820
So, learning and studying
acupuncture, herbology, massage;


01:00:24.940 --> 01:00:28.340
every meridian in
your body is an organ.


01:00:28.460 --> 01:00:29.900
Everything is corrected.


01:00:30.020 --> 01:00:32.620
Everything is connected
to your nervous system.


01:00:32.740 --> 01:00:35.500
Everything is connected
to your brain,


01:00:35.620 --> 01:00:37.540
all of your vital organs,


01:00:37.660 --> 01:00:42.700
spine has all of the nerves
coming into all of the organs.


01:00:42.820 --> 01:00:48.540
So we massage kidney, liver,
heart, spleen, everything.


01:00:48.660 --> 01:00:51.180
This is what I need to teach you


01:00:51.300 --> 01:00:55.340
so that you can
do the same to me.


01:00:55.460 --> 01:00:57.660
Do you understand?


01:01:05.900 --> 01:01:09.460
Hey, Cronus, why you doing this?


01:01:09.580 --> 01:01:11.020
Why you doing this?


01:01:11.140 --> 01:01:14.900
Sir, this has become my duty.


01:01:15.020 --> 01:01:16.220
I've seen you be tortured,


01:01:16.340 --> 01:01:19.700
and I've seen you make
decisions for the good.


01:01:19.820 --> 01:01:23.180
But that's because
I have no choice.


01:01:23.300 --> 01:01:24.340
You do.


01:01:24.460 --> 01:01:26.300
And I think about
every innocent life


01:01:26.420 --> 01:01:28.420
that I've needlessly taken.


01:01:28.540 --> 01:01:31.460
From now on, I'm in control.


01:01:56.780 --> 01:01:58.460
Where is she?


01:02:01.100 --> 01:02:03.100
Six minutes before
the lock changes.


01:02:03.220 --> 01:02:05.860
After that...


01:02:05.980 --> 01:02:08.500
Mission failed.


01:02:09.820 --> 01:02:11.900
Here she comes


01:02:29.700 --> 01:02:30.700
I'm going in.


01:02:30.820 --> 01:02:33.580
Take out the guard by the tower.


01:05:22.940 --> 01:05:24.940
Sit down brother, relax.


01:05:25.060 --> 01:05:25.820
It's okay.


01:05:25.940 --> 01:05:26.980
You took everything from me.


01:05:27.100 --> 01:05:28.380
Everything.


01:05:28.500 --> 01:05:29.260
Tell me,


01:05:29.380 --> 01:05:31.740
what's the meaning
of the truth to you?


01:05:31.860 --> 01:05:33.540
Truth.


01:05:33.660 --> 01:05:37.780
Truth is truth.
Fact.


01:05:37.900 --> 01:05:39.780
Everything we hear
is an opinion.


01:05:39.900 --> 01:05:40.900
It's not exactly a fact.


01:05:41.020 --> 01:05:43.220
Everything we see
is perspective,


01:05:43.340 --> 01:05:44.980
it's not necessarily the truth.


01:05:45.100 --> 01:05:46.420
What does that even mean?


01:05:46.540 --> 01:05:47.500
What does that mean?


01:05:47.620 --> 01:05:49.300
I wanna see if
I can come down,


01:05:49.420 --> 01:05:50.700
inside your mind a little bit,


01:05:50.820 --> 01:05:56.020
and see if you understand
what the real reality is.


01:05:56.140 --> 01:05:57.620
I'm gonna show you something.


01:05:57.740 --> 01:06:00.100
Take a look at this.


01:06:05.140 --> 01:06:07.140
<i>You sure
this place is safe?</i>


01:06:07.260 --> 01:06:10.220
Here you go, here's your truth


01:06:10.340 --> 01:06:15.660
<i>Yeah, yeah.
I went to great measures.</i>


01:06:15.780 --> 01:06:18.420
<i>You're hurt.</i>


01:06:18.540 --> 01:06:20.500
<i>Scratch.</i>


01:06:20.620 --> 01:06:23.060
He's a dangerous man


01:06:23.180 --> 01:06:26.700
Everything is going
according to the plan,


01:06:26.820 --> 01:06:30.260
Everything, right in
front of our eyes.


01:06:30.380 --> 01:06:32.180
I never doubted.


01:06:32.300 --> 01:06:35.340
He could have
pulled the trigger.


01:06:35.460 --> 01:06:37.300
You were lucky.


01:06:37.420 --> 01:06:38.660
It wasn't lucky.


01:06:38.780 --> 01:06:40.780
The Gulag 7 worked perfectly.


01:06:42.260 --> 01:06:45.180
<i>And he took out White.</i>


01:06:47.180 --> 01:06:51.220
It's almost too easy
manipulating these operatives.


01:06:51.340 --> 01:06:53.820
For years I implanted the vision


01:06:53.940 --> 01:06:56.300
of your face into his memory.


01:06:56.420 --> 01:06:59.820
I have been waiting
for this moment


01:06:59.940 --> 01:07:02.460
for so long.


01:07:03.820 --> 01:07:06.260
The loss of you made him cold.


01:07:06.380 --> 01:07:08.140
<i>He was too
emotionally detached,</i>


01:07:08.260 --> 01:07:11.580
<i>to refuse any order
I might give to him.</i>


01:07:11.700 --> 01:07:12.940
It was easy.


01:07:13.060 --> 01:07:17.660
He disposed of all
of my future rivals.


01:07:17.780 --> 01:07:20.700
My own personal killing machine.


01:07:20.820 --> 01:07:22.940
You planned this well.


01:07:23.060 --> 01:07:25.660
How can you be sure he's
gonna go against the Director?


01:07:25.780 --> 01:07:28.780
That's what makes
this part of the plan genius.


01:07:28.900 --> 01:07:33.020
Bringing you back to him
will give him hope and love.


01:07:33.140 --> 01:07:35.940
And his love for you,
even if he has never actually


01:07:36.060 --> 01:07:37.940
seen you in real life,


01:07:38.060 --> 01:07:42.540
it will make him hate the
Director and the State


01:07:42.660 --> 01:07:44.305
for taking you away from him.


01:07:44.425 --> 01:07:45.480
- It's genius.
- Would he care enough?


01:07:45.600 --> 01:07:46.800
<i>I mean he's a killing machine.</i>


01:07:46.920 --> 01:07:49.800
<i>Is he even capable of
loving another human being</i>


01:07:49.920 --> 01:07:52.600
<i>after everything you
have done to him?</i>


01:07:52.720 --> 01:07:55.600
<i>The doctors are working
on him as we speak,</i>


01:07:55.720 --> 01:07:58.920
prepping him for the final
stage of the plan.


01:07:59.040 --> 01:08:02.480
When he sees you,
he will see his one true love.


01:08:02.600 --> 01:08:07.560
And he will go to
war to keep you safe.


01:08:07.680 --> 01:08:11.480
That my dear


01:08:11.600 --> 01:08:15.960
is the perfect weapon.


01:08:16.080 --> 01:08:20.880
<i>Someone who believes that he's
fighting for something good,</i>


01:08:21.000 --> 01:08:22.840
something just,


01:08:22.960 --> 01:08:27.560
something called


01:08:28.680 --> 01:08:30.480
love.


01:08:32.640 --> 01:08:36.200
Once Condor kills the Director,


01:08:36.320 --> 01:08:41.320
we will expose the rebels for
the dreamers they really are,


01:08:41.440 --> 01:08:44.480
and we will be
heroes of the State.


01:08:44.600 --> 01:08:49.680
And I will become the
rightful, just leader


01:08:49.800 --> 01:08:55.320
that I was born to be,


01:08:55.440 --> 01:08:59.120
with you


01:08:59.240 --> 01:09:02.120
right by my side.


01:09:05.240 --> 01:09:09.880
That is your truth.


01:09:31.280 --> 01:09:33.840
Tell me.


01:09:35.080 --> 01:09:36.600
Tell me.


01:09:36.720 --> 01:09:38.840
It's finished.


01:09:38.960 --> 01:09:42.160
Mission accomplished.


01:09:46.640 --> 01:09:49.280
Something wrong here?


01:09:50.800 --> 01:09:53.960
Cronus is dead.


01:09:55.280 --> 01:09:59.360
Cronus is dead?


01:10:01.360 --> 01:10:05.240
Is the Director dead?


01:10:05.360 --> 01:10:06.440
Dead?


01:10:06.560 --> 01:10:09.080
You saw him dead?


01:10:09.200 --> 01:10:10.840
Yes.


01:10:10.960 --> 01:10:15.840
You know what this means?


01:10:15.960 --> 01:10:19.000
We can broadcast to the people.


01:10:19.120 --> 01:10:21.000
The Director's reign is over.


01:10:21.120 --> 01:10:22.480
Do you understand that?


01:10:22.600 --> 01:10:24.720
And what about the woman?


01:10:24.840 --> 01:10:27.320
Where does she fit in?


01:10:27.440 --> 01:10:28.840
She fits in!


01:10:28.960 --> 01:10:31.520
Where?


01:10:35.400 --> 01:10:38.240
By your side, I guess.


01:11:02.360 --> 01:11:04.720
You know, don't you?


01:11:05.880 --> 01:11:10.480
I can see it in your eyes.
They've changed.


01:11:10.600 --> 01:11:13.840
There is no love left
for me in them anymore.


01:11:15.760 --> 01:11:17.760
I had to do it.


01:11:17.880 --> 01:11:20.560
He made me.


01:11:20.680 --> 01:11:24.560
I mean, you've got to believe me
that I never meant to hurt you,


01:11:24.680 --> 01:11:28.240
or betray you.
I didn't know you,


01:11:28.360 --> 01:11:29.800
but I do now,


01:11:29.920 --> 01:11:35.480
and the past may
have been a lie,


01:11:35.600 --> 01:11:37.600
but this,


01:11:37.720 --> 01:11:40.440
this is real.


01:11:40.560 --> 01:11:42.560
I killed him,


01:11:42.680 --> 01:11:44.400
for you to keep you safe,


01:11:44.520 --> 01:11:47.120
the way you wanted
to keep me safe.


01:11:49.200 --> 01:11:55.760
Please Axon just tell me
there's still a chance.


01:11:55.880 --> 01:11:59.000
I love you.


01:11:59.120 --> 01:12:01.760
That part wasn't a lie.


01:12:06.560 --> 01:12:09.200
It's too late.


01:12:47.480 --> 01:12:49.320
The world is a cold place.


01:12:49.440 --> 01:12:52.400
Come on in, sit down
and warm yourself up.


01:12:57.680 --> 01:12:59.760
I'm finished.


01:12:59.880 --> 01:13:01.840
Man, you've done well Condor.


01:13:01.960 --> 01:13:03.920
I'm proud of you.


01:13:04.040 --> 01:13:06.040
The way I look at it,
you're just beginning.


01:13:06.160 --> 01:13:07.280
I've got big plans for you.


01:13:07.400 --> 01:13:10.440
First off, I'm in need
of a new Controller.


01:13:10.560 --> 01:13:12.720
I respectfully decline.


01:13:12.840 --> 01:13:15.120
I'm not asking, Condor.


01:13:15.240 --> 01:13:16.880
I'm giving you direct order.


01:13:17.000 --> 01:13:19.960
The State needs men like
you that I can trust.


01:13:20.080 --> 01:13:21.680
A new Controller,
you're gonna have


01:13:21.800 --> 01:13:23.120
respect, privilege, wealth.


01:13:23.240 --> 01:13:25.760
Your family will never
want for anything again.


01:13:25.880 --> 01:13:31.040
Family, I have no family.


01:13:38.360 --> 01:13:40.720
You just need a rest man.


01:13:40.840 --> 01:13:44.120
Get back on your feet.


01:13:45.280 --> 01:13:47.880
I'm gonna send you on
an extended vacation,


01:13:48.000 --> 01:13:49.960
give you a reward
for your loyalty.


01:13:50.080 --> 01:13:53.080
Beautiful island off the
coast should ease your mind.


01:13:53.200 --> 01:13:56.120
You've known everything
the whole time, haven't you?


01:13:56.240 --> 01:13:58.000
We suspected him for some time,


01:13:58.120 --> 01:14:00.000
but he's not the first traitor.


01:14:00.120 --> 01:14:01.600
And he ain't gonna be the last.


01:14:01.720 --> 01:14:02.520
And the woman?


01:14:02.640 --> 01:14:05.360
We knew what she was
when we recruited her,


01:14:05.480 --> 01:14:08.520
just like we knew what you
were when we recruited you.


01:14:08.640 --> 01:14:11.800
We always know.


01:14:21.880 --> 01:14:23.440
Let's drink to the future


01:14:23.560 --> 01:14:26.000
and the new place
that you're holding.


01:14:26.120 --> 01:14:29.480
You're right.


01:14:29.600 --> 01:14:32.360
I do belong here.


01:14:32.480 --> 01:14:36.040
The only problem is,


01:14:36.160 --> 01:14:38.400
my nature.


01:14:38.520 --> 01:14:41.120
You see the only
thing I know how to do


01:14:45.080 --> 01:14:46.560
is kill.


01:14:46.680 --> 01:14:49.880
Nature is a hard
thing to fight.


01:14:50.000 --> 01:14:52.680
It really is.


01:15:34.560 --> 01:15:40.680
This is my destiny.


01:16:43.080 --> 01:16:46.480
Freedom.


01:17:44.160 --> 01:17:46.560
I think we just found
our new symbol of hope.


01:18:13.520 --> 01:18:16.160
My brother.


01:18:16.280 --> 01:18:19.720
Mission complete, sir.


01:18:19.840 --> 01:18:22.520
Almost.


01:18:22.640 --> 01:18:24.800
You've done a wonderful
job for me, brother.


01:18:24.920 --> 01:18:28.240
I'm really proud of you
and really grateful to you.


01:18:28.360 --> 01:18:31.400
It breaks my heart
to see you like this.


01:18:31.520 --> 01:18:34.920
You gave me your life.
You gave me everything.


01:18:35.040 --> 01:18:37.320
My people say,


01:18:37.440 --> 01:18:42.840
"You can judge a man's entire
life by his last breath."


01:18:42.960 --> 01:18:46.800
We not only live life with
honor, but we die with honor,


01:18:46.920 --> 01:18:48.880
and that's what you have done.


01:18:49.000 --> 01:18:52.520
Give me an honorable death.


01:19:02.200 --> 01:19:06.200
You have my word.


01:19:06.320 --> 01:19:08.080
Avenge me brother.

